Background dataset has 500 samples but max_samples=100. Subsampling to 100 samples for SHAP value computation. To use all samples, set max_samples=500 when initializing the masker.
=== parameters ===
reuse lab01 frame rows=36300 HORIZON=5 purged folds=5 embargo=5
LightGBM available=True; SHAP available=True
eval: RankIC + net SR (shared cost) + DSR over configs — NOT accuracy
cite: Qlib docs — Alpha158 handler + LGBModel (qlib.contrib.model.gbdt) workflow
cite: AFML ch.10 bet sizing from predicted probabilities
frontier: arXiv:2511.18578 Re(Visiting) TSFMs in Finance — zero-shot Chronos/TimesFM underperform LightGBM/CatBoost on excess returns
frontier: arXiv:2412.09880 — baseline TimesFM unsatisfactory on price prediction before finance fine-tune
frontier: arXiv:2606.27100 — TSFM gains vs random walk small/sparse on equity returns
LLM agents deferred to P8

