=== probability calibration + AFML ch.10 bet sizing ===
raw_prob mean=0.514 meta_base_rate=0.515
calibration: reliability curve raw vs isotonic (Platt/logit also common; we show isotonic)
bet_sizing net_SR=-0.917 turn=0.1752
teach: size from calibrated probs, not raw scores; bad calibration → bad Kelly-like bets
chart /workspace/Quant-trading-learn/public/p5/calibration_reliability.png

=== Qlib-style workflow (plain pandas equivalent) ===
Qlib pattern (from official docs): Alpha158 DataHandler → DatasetH segments → LGBModel.fit → SignalRecord
pandas equivalent here:
  1) features_long ≈ Alpha158 processors (mom/vol/rank; CSZScoreNorm ↔ StandardScaler on train fold)
  2) purged segments ≈ DatasetH train/valid/test without label overlap
  3) LGBMRegressor/Ridge ≈ LGBModel
  4) pred_to_ls_pnl ≈ portfolio analysis from scores
We do NOT claim Qlib install in this lab; cite docs and mirror the stages.
